{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579650/extras/279e318adfa8acf084e4f1344057c914.poster.avif?t=1757530605\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579650/extras/279e318adfa8acf084e4f1344057c914.webm?t=1757530605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579650/extras/279e318adfa8acf084e4f1344057c914.mp4?t=1757530605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NULLPTR is a real-time tactical hacking puzzle, nominated as a finalist for Innovation and Best Brazilian Game at Gamescom LATAM 2024, where every action you take reshapes the challenge ahead. Infiltrate megacorp servers, reroute connections, collect valuable data, and outmaneuver adaptive defenses, all while racing against the clock and the relentless threat of reactive sentinels.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579650/extras/c35b5c4edce55baabab42929a8d52c78.poster.avif?t=1757530605\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579650/extras/c35b5c4edce55baabab42929a8d52c78.webm?t=1757530605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579650/extras/c35b5c4edce55baabab42929a8d52c78.mp4?t=1757530605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time tactical puzzles</strong> \u2013 Every move matters as adaptive defense systems react dynamically to your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20-second infiltration window</strong> \u2013 Plan carefully and execute quickly before the trace monitor locks you out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reversible routes</strong> \u2013 Your movement leaves behind a visible trace; retrace your steps to erase it and reduce your exposure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stack memory system</strong> \u2013 Store, reorder, and rewrite data nodes to alter the environment and exploit the system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive defenses</strong> \u2013 Sentinels, gates and firewalls respond to your behavior, turning obstacles into potential tools if used cleverly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emergent gameplay</strong> \u2013 Discover loopholes, bend the rules, and transform threats into opportunities through creative play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging progression</strong> \u2013 Over 150 handcrafted stages across four powerful megacorporations, each with unique security systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ghost runs</strong> \u2013 Complete servers without detection to record your best times and prove mastery of the system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cyberpunk aesthetic</strong> \u2013 A minimalist, high-contrast style inspired by classic terminals and retro hacking culture.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1579650?t=1757530605","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1579650?t=1757530605","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579650/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757530605","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579650/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757530605","categories":[{"description":"Single-pl